Attribution / provenance
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

OpenArtemis is a derivative work. Its lineage is:

  ARTEX        by @Autumn-27     https://github.com/Autumn-27
    └── AntiFox by AntiFox-AI     https://github.com/AntiFox-AI/antifox
          └── OpenArtemis (this project)

AntiFox is itself a fork of ARTEX that re-centered the engineering on
evidence-driven delivery. OpenArtemis builds on AntiFox's foundation (dual-graph
exploration engine, MITM traffic capture, rule-based HITL interception,
multi-agent orchestration) and focuses on making open-weight local models
usable as the reasoning core of an autonomous penetration-testing loop.

We gratefully acknowledge the foundational work of the ARTEX and AntiFox
authors. Under the terms of AGPL-3.0 the complete corresponding source of
OpenArtemis is published in this repository.

Inline source comments that read "AntiFox 0.3.x" refer to specific upstream
versions a given mechanism was ported from, and are preserved as attribution.
